Here's what you can ask this system to do by email:

- Email a .vtt transcript file to have it added to your group's records. Mention which group
  it's for if you belong to more than one.
- Ask for the status of a previous request (mention the job ID, e.g. DIAR-2026-0811-0017, or
  just reply on the original email thread).
- Ask for the results of a previous request.
- Ask to cancel a previous request, if it hasn't already been processed.

Audio recordings aren't accepted by email - please contact the admin to have those added
directly.
